          "expr": "100 * (sum(rate(gateway_errors_total{route=~\"$route\", method=~\"$method\"}[$__rate_interval])) or vector(0)) / (sum(rate(gateway_requests_total{route=~\"$route\", method=~\"$method\"}[$__rate_interval])) > 0)",
